{"hw":"δικαστής","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δικαστής</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δικαστ-ής</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">οῦ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">a judge,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.96</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.14</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">120</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">81</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> of stars, <span class=\"gk\">δ. τῶν ὅλων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.31</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> at Athens and elsewh., <b class=\"lex-tr\">juror,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1136</span> </span>, etc.; opp. <span class=\"gk\">νομοθέτης,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.4</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.23</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.10</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">δ. αἵματος</span> <